---
// The six review layers from "How I Trust Code I Didn't Write", drawn as a Swiss cheese model.
// Inline SVG so it follows the site's light and dark colors.
---

<figure class="layers">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 474 236" role="img" aria-labelledby="layers-title">
    <title id="layers-title">
      Six layers drawn as slices with holes: types, example tests, property tests, mutation testing, stateful
      tests, human review. A bug passes through holes in the first two and is stopped by the property tests.
    </title>
    <g>
      <rect class="slab" x="20" y="20" width="44" height="170" rx="4" />
      <ellipse class="hole" cx="42" cy="100" rx="11" ry="14" />
      <ellipse class="hole" cx="38" cy="50" rx="7" ry="8" />
      <ellipse class="hole" cx="45" cy="155" rx="8" ry="10" />
      <text class="num" x="42" y="212">1</text>
      <text class="name" x="42" y="228">types</text>
    </g>
    <g>
      <rect class="slab" x="98" y="20" width="44" height="170" rx="4" />
      <ellipse class="hole" cx="120" cy="100" rx="11" ry="14" />
      <ellipse class="hole" cx="122" cy="45" rx="9" ry="11" />
      <ellipse class="hole" cx="117" cy="145" rx="10" ry="12" />
      <ellipse class="hole" cx="124" cy="180" rx="6" ry="7" />
      <text class="num" x="120" y="212">2</text>
      <text class="name" x="120" y="228">examples</text>
    </g>
    <g class="stop">
      <rect class="slab" x="176" y="20" width="44" height="170" rx="4" />
      <ellipse class="hole" cx="200" cy="55" rx="7" ry="9" />
      <ellipse class="hole" cx="195" cy="160" rx="8" ry="10" />
      <text class="num" x="198" y="212">3</text>
      <text class="name" x="198" y="228">properties</text>
    </g>
    <g>
      <rect class="slab" x="254" y="20" width="44" height="170" rx="4" />
      <ellipse class="hole" cx="276" cy="70" rx="8" ry="10" />
      <ellipse class="hole" cx="279" cy="140" rx="6" ry="8" />
      <text class="num" x="276" y="212">4</text>
      <text class="name" x="276" y="228">mutation</text>
    </g>
    <g>
      <rect class="slab" x="332" y="20" width="44" height="170" rx="4" />
      <ellipse class="hole" cx="352" cy="45" rx="6" ry="7" />
      <ellipse class="hole" cx="356" cy="120" rx="8" ry="11" />
      <ellipse class="hole" cx="354" cy="172" rx="5" ry="6" />
      <text class="num" x="354" y="212">5</text>
      <text class="name" x="354" y="228">stateful</text>
    </g>
    <g>
      <rect class="slab" x="410" y="20" width="44" height="170" rx="4" />
      <ellipse class="hole" cx="435" cy="90" rx="7" ry="9" />
      <ellipse class="hole" cx="430" cy="160" rx="6" ry="8" />
      <text class="num" x="432" y="212">6</text>
      <text class="name" x="432" y="228">review</text>
    </g>
    <g class="bug">
      <text class="label" x="0" y="90">bug</text>
      <path d="M0 100H20M31 100H53M64 100H98M109 100H131M142 100H166" />
      <polygon points="175,100 166,95.5 166,104.5" />
      <text class="caught" x="198" y="12">caught</text>
    </g>
  </svg>
  <figcaption>
    Each layer misses some bugs. The planted bug later in this post gets past the types and the example test, and
    the property tests catch it.
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .layers {
    margin: 2.25rem 0;
  }

  svg {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 34rem;
    margin-inline: auto;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 12px;
  }

  .slab {
    fill: var(--surface);
    stroke: var(--muted);
    stroke-opacity: 0.5;
  }

  .stop .slab {
    stroke: var(--accent);
    stroke-opacity: 1;
  }

  .hole {
    fill: var(--bg);
    stroke: var(--rule);
  }

  text {
    text-anchor: middle;
  }

  .num {
    fill: var(--accent);
  }

  .name,
  .label {
    fill: var(--muted);
  }

  .label {
    text-anchor: start;
  }

  .bug path {
    fill: none;
    stroke: var(--fg);
    stroke-width: 1.5;
  }

  .bug polygon {
    fill: var(--fg);
  }

  .caught {
    fill: var(--accent);
  }

  /* On phones the names get too small to read; the numbered list just above carries them. */
  @media (max-width: 30rem) {
    .name {
      display: none;
    }

    svg {
      font-size: 17px;
    }

    .num {
      transform: translateY(6px);
    }
  }

  figcaption {
    margin-top: 0.75rem;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--muted);
  }
</style>
